<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR DROPS TO 11.63PCT FROM 11.84PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR DROPS TO 11.63PCT FROM 11.84PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
